## Architecture Decision

We adopt a **two-tier** design:

1. **Tier 1 — In-cluster Git replica:** One Git HTTP service in the cluster, on a dedicated block volume (`ReadWriteOnce`, e.g. gp3). Corporate GitLab is only the north–south source (mirror push / webhook on merge).
2. **Tier 2 — Three node DaemonSets:** On every worker, three separate jobs (sync, FUSE export, CSI attach) so they can fail and upgrade independently. Apps get a normal folder at `/mnt/git` via a CSI ephemeral volume.

```
[Primary GitLab (Trunk `main`)]
               │
               ▼ (North-South: 1 Mirror Push / Webhook on Merge)
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ In-Cluster Git Replica Pod (per Cluster)                    │
│   ├── Dedicated Block PVC (RWO, gp3/NVMe)                   │
│   ├── Bare Repository (/data/repo.git)                      │
│   └── post-receive hook -> ConfigMap: `git-release-state`   │
└──────────────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────┘
                               │
                               ▼ (K8s API Watch + Intra-Cluster East-West Pull)
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Worker Node (Host Mount Namespace via `nsenter`)            │
│ Dedicated Storage: /mnt/git-storage/{backend,fuse}          │
│                                                             │
│  ┌───────────────────────┐   ┌───────────────────────────┐  │
│  │   git-reconciler DS   │   │        git-fuse DS        │  │
│  │ (Watch + Git CLI Pull)│   │ (Long-lived FUSE Engine)  │  │
│  └───────────┬───────────┘   └─────────────┬─────────────┘  │
│              │ Updates                     │ Exports        │
│              ▼                             ▼                │
│     /mnt/git-storage/backend     /mnt/git-storage/fuse      │
│                                            │                │
│                              ┌─────────────┴─────────────┐  │
│                              │        git-csi DS         │  │
│                              │  (Thin Bind-Mount gRPC)   │  │
│                              └─────────────┬─────────────┘  │
│                                            │ Bind-mount     │
│                                            ▼                │
│                     Kubelet Pod Volume (/mnt/git/)          │
└────────────────────────────────────────────┬────────────────┘
                                             ▼
                        [Application Pod] (100% Unprivileged)
                        Reads /mnt/git via $CONFIG_PATH

```

