## Consistency Model

* **Model:** per-node **eventual consistency** (each node fetches and flips on its own).
* **Lab baseline (3× m5.large EKS):** converge in about **2–6 seconds** after ConfigMap update (spread ≈ 3s).
* **SLO stance:** multi-second mixed-version windows across nodes are **normal**. Sub-second cluster-wide atomic flips are **not** promised. Fleet-scale monorepo latency still needs characterization.

